<DATA=Code>
  2009-01-01 12:00  => IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* SSG-4 (MT-069): one RECAP for every call. Field, amount, key
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* and NEURO lists come from the SGSPARM file written by the
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* skeleton hand-off; behaviour: Generic/RECAP/spec.md. The RDMS
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* session of the skeleton is not kept (spec A2); EUU003 is
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* called as in the skeleton (spec A3).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PROGRAM-ID. 'RECAP-GN'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => CONFIGURATION SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => SOURCE-COMPUTER. UNIVAC-1100-10.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => OBJECT-COMPUTER. UNIVAC-1100-10.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FILE-CONTROL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT PARMF ASSIGN TO DISC SGSPARM.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT FI1 ASSIGN TO DISC RECAPIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     SELECT FO1 ASSIGN TO DISC RECAPOUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => DATA DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FILE SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  PARMF
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  PARM-REC.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  P-TYPE         PIC XX.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  P-POS          PIC 9(5).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  P-LEN          PIC 9(5).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER         PIC X(68).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  FI1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     RECORD VARYING IN SIZE FROM 1 TO 4001
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DEPENDING ON WS-IN-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  FI1-REC PIC X(4001).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FD  FO1
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     LABEL RECORD STANDARD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  FO1-REC PIC X(4000).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  RECIN              PIC X(4001).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-IN              PIC X(4001).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  RECOUT             PIC X(4000).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-KEY             PIC X(4001).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  PREV-KEY           PIC X(4001).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  WS-IN-LEN          PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-INLEN            PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  P-OUTLEN           PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  CP-LEN             PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  KP                 PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  KEY-LEN            PIC 9(5) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  N-FI               PIC 9(3) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  N-FO               PIC 9(3) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  N-TI               PIC 9(3) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  N-TO               PIC 9(3) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  N-IN               PIC 9(3) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  I                  PIC 9(3) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  AP                 PIC 9(3) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  TESTFIN            PIC 9 VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  PREMIER            PIC 9 VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  NB-LUS             PIC 9(10) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 77  NB-ECR             PIC 9(10) COMP VALUE 0.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  FI-TAB.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FI-ENT OCCURS 50.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  FI-POS     PIC 9(5) COMP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  FI-LEN     PIC 9(5) COMP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  FO-TAB.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FO-ENT OCCURS 50.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  FO-POS     PIC 9(5) COMP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  FO-LEN     PIC 9(5) COMP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  TI-TAB.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  TI-ENT OCCURS 30.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  TI-POS     PIC 9(5) COMP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  TI-LEN     PIC 9(5) COMP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  TO-TAB.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  TO-ENT OCCURS 30.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  TO-POS     PIC 9(5) COMP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  TO-LEN     PIC 9(5) COMP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  IN-TAB.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  IN-ENT OCCURS 30.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  IN-POS     PIC 9(5) COMP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  IN-LEN     PIC 9(5) COMP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  NE-TAB.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  NE-FLAG        PIC X OCCURS 30.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  AMOUNTS.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  REC-AMT        PIC S9(18) OCCURS 30.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  TOT-GRP        PIC S9(18) OCCURS 30.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  TOTAL-LU       PIC S9(18) OCCURS 30.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  MONT           PIC S9(18) OCCURS 30.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* an amount, right-aligned in 18 digits (skeleton TOTAL<i>)
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-AMT             PIC S9(18).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-AMT-X REDEFINES WS-AMT PIC X(18).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* a sum written into the output (skeleton TOTAL-O<i>)
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-SUM             PIC S9(18).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-SUM-X REDEFINES WS-SUM PIC X(18).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* a grand total before DISPLAY (skeleton TOTAL-LU<i>, MONT<i>)
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-T18             PIC S9(18).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-T18-X REDEFINES WS-T18 PIC X(18).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-CNT             PIC 9(6).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-CNT-X REDEFINES WS-CNT PIC X(6).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* EUW002 and WS-CMT-PGM: as in SSG-Source/RECAP.TXT 187-256
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  EUW002.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-PTR-ENE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  WS-PTR-ENE-MON-ENE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>             07  MT-ENE              PIC S9(17).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>             07  MT-ENE-SGN          PIC X(01).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>             07  MT-ENE-CHI          PIC 9(02).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  WS-PTR-ENE-MON-SRT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>             07  LG-MAX-MON-SRT      PIC 9(03).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>             07  CD-FMT-MON-SRT      PIC X(01).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>             07  WS-PTR-FAC-MON-SRT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                 09  FL-IMP-APO      PIC X(01).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                 09  FL-IMP-EUR      PIC X(01).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                 09  FL-IMP-BEF      PIC X(01).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                 09  FL-PLT-SGN      PIC X(01).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                 09  FL-TRD-SGN      PIC X(01).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                 09  FL-SGN-FIX      PIC X(01).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                 09  FL-SGN-VUE      PIC X(01).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                 09  FL-CAD-PRC      PIC X(01).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                 09  FL-CAD-CNV      PIC X(01).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                 09  FL-IMP-PNT      PIC X(01).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                 09  FL-000          PIC X(01).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                 09  CD-DET-MON      PIC X(01).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>                 09  FILLER          PIC X(19).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-PTR-SRT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  WS-MON-SRT-001.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>             07  MT-SRT              PIC X(100).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  WS-MON-SRT-002.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>             07  MT-SRT-PRC          PIC X(50).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>             07  MT-SRT-CNV          PIC X(50).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>             07  TL-PTH-GCH          PIC X(01).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>             07  TL-PTH-DRT          PIC X(01).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  LG-MON-SRT              PIC 9(02).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  LB-DVI-PRC              PIC X(03).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  LB-DVI-CNV              PIC X(03).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-PTR-ENE-SRT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  FILLER                  PIC X(10).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  WS-IFN-EUR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>         05  FILLER                  PIC X(10).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => 01  WS-CMT-PGM.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  NM-PGM-APL               PIC X(08).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  NM-NOM-ENV               PIC X(08).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  NM-NOM-COP               PIC X(08).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  NM-NOM-DEM               PIC X(08).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  VL-CDE-RET               PIC S9(04).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  VL-MOT-CDE               PIC S9(04).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  LB-MSG-RET               PIC X(30).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  CD-DBG-PRG               PIC X(1).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  FILLER                   PIC X(7).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     03  VL-CHP-TSF               PIC X(3922).
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PROCEDURE DIVISION.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => DEBUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE ALL 'N' TO NE-TAB.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN INPUT PARMF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PARM-LECT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     READ PARMF AT END GO TO PARM-FIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'HD'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-POS TO P-INLEN
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-LEN TO P-OUTLEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'FI'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        ADD 1 TO N-FI
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-POS TO FI-POS (N-FI)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-LEN TO FI-LEN (N-FI).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'FO'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        ADD 1 TO N-FO
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-POS TO FO-POS (N-FO)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-LEN TO FO-LEN (N-FO).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'TI'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        ADD 1 TO N-TI
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-POS TO TI-POS (N-TI)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-LEN TO TI-LEN (N-TI).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'TO'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        ADD 1 TO N-TO
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-POS TO TO-POS (N-TO)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-LEN TO TO-LEN (N-TO).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'IN'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        ADD 1 TO N-IN
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-POS TO IN-POS (N-IN)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-LEN TO IN-LEN (N-IN).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF P-TYPE = 'NE'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 'Y' TO NE-FLAG (P-POS).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO PARM-LECT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => PARM-FIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE PARMF.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE ZEROES TO AMOUNTS.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 'RECAP'     TO NM-PGM-APL   OF WS-CMT-PGM.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 'BATCH'     TO NM-NOM-ENV   OF WS-CMT-PGM.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 'Y'         TO CD-DBG-PRG   OF WS-CMT-PGM.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 'EUW002'    TO NM-NOM-COP   OF WS-CMT-PGM.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 'SERVICE1'  TO NM-NOM-DEM   OF WS-CMT-PGM.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES      TO WS-PTR-ENE   OF EUW002.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 'R'         TO FL-PLT-SGN   OF EUW002.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE '2'         TO FL-TRD-SGN   OF EUW002.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 'Y'         TO MT-ENE-SGN   OF EUW002.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE '1'         TO CD-FMT-MON-SRT  OF EUW002.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 'Y'         TO FL-IMP-PNT      OF EUW002.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 'N'         TO FL-000          OF EUW002.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN INPUT FI1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     OPEN OUTPUT FO1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO RECOUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => LECT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO RECIN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     READ FI1 INTO RECIN AT END
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 1 TO TESTFIN
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        GO TO RUPTURE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO NB-LUS.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO WS-IN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-IN-LEN TO CP-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF CP-LEN > P-INLEN
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE P-INLEN TO CP-LEN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF CP-LEN > 0
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE RECIN (1:CP-LEN) TO WS-IN (1:CP-LEN).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* amounts: not numeric -> spaces become 0 in the record (spec A6)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => AMT-LOOP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF I > N-TI GO TO AMT-END.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM AMT-LOAD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF WS-AMT NOT NUMERIC
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        INSPECT WS-IN (TI-POS (I):TI-LEN (I))
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>          REPLACING ALL SPACE BY '0'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        PERFORM AMT-LOAD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-AMT TO REC-AMT (I).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD WS-AMT TO TOTAL-LU (I).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO AMT-LOOP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => AMT-END.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* key = the INDIC parts in card order
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO KP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => KEY-LOOP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF I > N-IN GO TO KEY-END.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-IN (IN-POS (I):IN-LEN (I))
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       TO WS-KEY (KP:IN-LEN (I)).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD IN-LEN (I) TO KP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO KEY-LOOP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => KEY-END.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     COMPUTE KEY-LEN = KP - 1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF PREMIER = 0
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 1 TO PREMIER
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        GO TO EGALITE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF PREV-KEY (1:KEY-LEN) > WS-KEY (1:KEY-LEN)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        GO TO ERR-SEQ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF PREV-KEY (1:KEY-LEN) NOT = WS-KEY (1:KEY-LEN)
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        GO TO RUPTURE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO EGALITE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => RUPTURE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => RUP-LOOP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF I > N-TO GO TO RUP-WRITE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE TOT-GRP (I) TO WS-SUM.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     COMPUTE AP = 19 - TO-LEN (I).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-SUM-X (AP:TO-LEN (I))
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       TO RECOUT (TO-POS (I):TO-LEN (I)).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE ZEROES TO TOT-GRP (I).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO RUP-LOOP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => RUP-WRITE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     WRITE FO1-REC FROM RECOUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE SPACES TO RECOUT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO NB-ECR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF TESTFIN = 1 GO TO FINW.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => EGALITE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => EGA-LOOP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF I > N-FI GO TO EGA-TOT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-IN (FI-POS (I):FI-LEN (I))
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       TO RECOUT (FO-POS (I):FO-LEN (I)).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO EGA-LOOP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => EGA-TOT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => EGA-TLOOP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF I > N-TO GO TO EGA-END.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD REC-AMT (I) TO TOT-GRP (I) MONT (I).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO EGA-TLOOP.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => EGA-END.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-KEY TO PREV-KEY.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO LECT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => ERR-SEQ.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY '**ANCIEN INDIC** ' PREV-KEY (1:KEY-LEN).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY '**NOUVEL INDIC** ' WS-KEY (1:KEY-LEN).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY '**ERREUR DE SEQUENCE** '.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE FI1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE FO1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CALL 'ABORT'.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     STOP RUN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FINW.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY  '*RECAP  FIN*'  UPON  PRINTER.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE NB-LUS TO WS-CNT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     INSPECT WS-CNT-X REPLACING LEADING '0' BY SPACE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY  '*NB-ENREG-LUS ='  WS-CNT-X  UPON  PRINTER.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FIN-LU.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF I > N-TI GO TO FIN-ECR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE TOTAL-LU (I) TO WS-T18.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM FIN-TOTAL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO FIN-LU.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FIN-ECR.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE NB-ECR TO WS-CNT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     INSPECT WS-CNT-X REPLACING LEADING '0' BY SPACE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     DISPLAY  '*NB-ENREG-ECR ='  WS-CNT-X  UPON  PRINTER.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE 1 TO I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FIN-MONT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF I > N-TO GO TO FIN-END.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE MONT (I) TO WS-T18.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     PERFORM FIN-TOTAL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ADD 1 TO I.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     GO TO FIN-MONT.
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FIN-END.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE  FI1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     CLOSE  FO1.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     STOP RUN.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* one grand-total line: raw when listed on NEURO, else EUU003
  2009-01-01 12:00  => FIN-TOTAL.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     INSPECT WS-T18-X REPLACING LEADING '0' BY SPACE.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     IF NE-FLAG (I) = 'Y'
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        DISPLAY WS-T18-X UPON PRINTER
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     ELSE
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 17     TO MT-ENE-CHI OF EUW002
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE 25     TO LG-MAX-MON-SRT OF EUW002
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE WS-T18 TO MT-ENE OF EUW002
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE EUW002       TO VL-CHP-TSF  OF WS-CMT-PGM
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        CALL 'EUU003'     USING WS-CMT-PGM
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        MOVE VL-CHP-TSF   OF WS-CMT-PGM TO EUW002
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>        DISPLAY MT-SRT    OF EUW002 UPON PRINTER.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>* amount I of WS-IN, right-aligned with leading zeros in WS-AMT
  2009-01-01 12:00  => AMT-LOAD.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE ALL '0' TO WS-AMT-X.
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     COMPUTE AP = 19 - TI-LEN (I).
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>     MOVE WS-IN (TI-POS (I):TI-LEN (I))
  2009-01-01 12:00  =>       TO WS-AMT-X (AP:TI-LEN (I)).
</DATA>
<DATA=Documentation>
  -MAP-
  Documentation
  * SSG-4 (MT-069): one RECAP for every call. Field, amount, key
  * and NEURO lists come from the SGSPARM file written by the
  * skeleton hand-off; behaviour: Generic/RECAP/spec.md. The RDMS
  * session of the skeleton is not kept (spec A2); EUU003 is
  * called as in the skeleton (spec A3).
  PROGRAM-ID. .
  -MAPEND-
  -MAP-
  Technical issues
  -MAPEND-
</DATA>
